FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS -- SUPER ZZ ZERO

 [0] GENERAL/MISCELLANEOUS
   [0.1] What is the MIME type, UTI type, etc?

 [1] COMPILING AND SYSTEM COMPATIBILITY
   [1.1] Why doesn't it run on a headless system?
